- **Nearest real match, deliberately not touched.** `logs/scripts/entry-count.sh:5` greps `'^## '` to count entries that actually start with `### ` — genuinely a section-heading parsing bug, but against `logs/incident-log.md`, not `docs/healthy-doc.md`. It is already triaged in `audits/working/2026-08-10-resolve-entry-count-miscounts.md`. Fixing it here would have breached the bounded-implementation rule; say the word and I'll run it as its own incident.
